WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 bd726eea0809593d0cd98aa7f3d0000e

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.260
Karibu tena. Hadi sasa, umekuwa ukitumia vitendakazi

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.960
nilivyokuundia, vitendakazi kama circle,

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.459
rectangle, moveRight, shoot. Vyote hivyo ni

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.220
vitendakazi nilivyounda na kuviweka

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:14.920
kwenye rafu za Jiki. Lakini sasa umefika wakati

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:18.460
wa wewe kuanza kuunda vitendakazi vyako mwenyewe. Sasa, ili

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.030
kukuonyesha jinsi ya kufanya hivi,

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.180
tutaangalia kuunda kitendakazi kipya

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:27.330
kwa ajili ya labirenti kiitwacho walk5. Kitendakazi hiki daima

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.500
kitasogeza mhusika hatua tano mbele.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.220
Kwa kweli, hiki si kitendakazi chenye manufaa zaidi

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.200
duniani, lakini ni rahisi na kizuri

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.140
kwa ajili yetu kuanzia nacho. Kwa hiyo,

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:39.140
kama ningekuomba uandike

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:42.040
msimbo wa kusogeza mhusika mbele hatua

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:46.190
tano, ungeweza kuandika move mara tano,

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:48.390
au ungeweza kutumia kitanzi cha repeat. Katika

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:50.700
mfano huu, ili tu kuweka mambo rahisi,

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:53.260
tutatumia njia ya kuandika move mara tano

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:56.040
mfululizo. Kwa hiyo, hayo ndiyo tunayotaka

00:00:56.100 --> 00:01:00.070
yawe ndani ya kitendakazi chetu. Sasa, nitaongeza

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:03.000
mstari chini ya hapo unaomwambia Jiki

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:05.260
kutumia kitendakazi hiki. Umeona hili mara nyingi.

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:08.100
Na kisha kazi yetu itakuwa

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:10.840
kufunga mistari hii mitano ya kwanza yote

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:14.060
ndani ya kitendakazi ili Jiki anapotumia

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:17.860
walk5, iwe ni mistari hiyo mitano ya kwanza ya msimbo

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:21.400
inayoendeshwa. Sasa, ili kugeuza mistari hii mitano

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.640
kuwa kitendakazi, yaani move hizi tano kuwa

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:26.290
kitendakazi, tunahitaji kutumia keyword mpya,

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:30.280
ambayo ni keyword ya function. Tunapotumia

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.480
keyword ya function, tunapaswa kufanya mambo

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:36.100
mawili. Kwanza, kutaja jina la kitendakazi.

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:39.660
Katika kesi hii, ni walk5. Na pili, kutumia

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:42.310
mabano yaliyopinda kufunga msimbo unaosema,

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:44.380
“Hivi ndivyo unapaswa kufanya ndani ya

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:47.540
kitendakazi.” Kwa hiyo tunaweza kuongeza hiyo kwenye

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:49.960
msimbo wetu, na sasa tunamwambia Jiki aunde

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.400
kitendakazi kiitwacho walk5, na kisha walk5

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:56.080
inapotumika, aendeshe mistari hii mitano

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:00.340
ya msimbo. Jiki anapoona keyword hiyo ya function,

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:02.240
ataenda kuunda

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:05.560
kitendakazi kipya, kuweka maagizo hayo kwenye ubao

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:08.039
ndani yake, na kisha kuweka lebo

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.580
kwenye mashine kwa ajili ya walk5. Kisha

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:13.760
ataweka kitendakazi hicho kwenye rafu pamoja na

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:14.760
vingine vyote vilivyopo.

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:18.080
Sasa, hakuna lolote la pekee kuhusu kitendakazi hiki

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:20.120
ulichounda ukilinganisha na vile nilivyounda.

00:02:20.489 --> 00:02:22.080
Vyote viko kando ya kimoja na kingine

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:25.700
kwenye rafu zake. Na unapotumia

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:29.600
kitendakazi, unapoandika walk5 na mabano, Jiki

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:31.340
ataenda tu kuchukua mashine kutoka

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:33.960
kwenye rafu na kuitumia sawa sawa

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.160
na alivyokuwa akifanya na kitendakazi kingine chochote.

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:39.380
Unaweza kufikiria kwamba kila mashine ina

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:42.329
Jiki mdogo anayeishi ndani yake. Jiki mdogo

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:44.920
huvaa kofia ya kuvutia kila wakati. Na Jiki huyo

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.450
mdogo anafanya kazi kwa njia sawa sawa na

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:50.600
Jiki wa kawaida aliye nje, akifuata maagizo

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:54.560
kwa njia ile ile. Jambo moja muhimu la kuelewa

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:57.310
hapa ni kwamba Jiki anapounda kitendakazi,

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:00.560
haendeshi msimbo huo kwa kweli. Anaandika tu

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.840
msimbo huo ili autumie baadaye.

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:06.160
Mhusika aliye kwenye labirenti hasogei

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.640
wakati huu unapoandika keyword ya function. Jiki

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:11.560
ameunda mashine na kuiweka

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:14.080
kwenye rafu. Hadi unapomwambia

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:16.960
kutumia mashine kwa kuandika walk5 na mabano,

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:20.880
ndipo hilo linatokea kwa kweli. Nitakupa

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:24.340
mazoezi mawili sasa ili uzoee

00:03:24.360 --> 00:03:27.080
dhana hii. Utahitaji kugawanya msimbo

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:30.280
tata zaidi kuwa vitendakazi vidogo, na

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:32.740
natumaini utaona jinsi msimbo wako unavyopendeza

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:34.940
zaidi mwishoni. Na kisha tutaonana

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.620
hapa tena hivi karibuni kuangalia jinsi

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:38.660
tunavyoweza kuunda vitendakazi vyenye maingizo.
